# Mio Language — GitHub Linguist configuration
# Until Mio is registered in github-linguist, use JavaScript as the
# closest available syntax-highlighting / language-statistics fallback.
# Note: GitHub will display these files as JavaScript, not as Mio.
*.mio linguist-language=JavaScript linguist-detectable

# Compiled Mio bytecode (only applies if such files are committed).
*.miob binary linguist-generated -linguist-detectable
